ABOUT A MONTH AFTER HE DIED.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:02.388 line:0%
YAKUTSK IN THROUGH THIS

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.423 line:0%
APARTMENT, IT IS OF TIME HAS

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:05.225 line:0%
STOOD STILL.

