THERE'S STILL FOOD AND DRINKS

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.228 line:0%
ON THE COUNTER.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:09.229 line:0%
MAIL ON THE FLOOR, IF YOU TAKE

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.464 line:0%
A LOOK AROUND THIS APARTMENT

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:12.098 line:0%
THERE IS GARBAGE AND CLOTHES

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.700 line:0%
SCATTERED EVERYWHERE.

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:17.303 line:0%
IT IS A HEARTBREAKING SCENE.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.670 line:0%
IT IS ALL TOO COMMON HERE IN

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.273 line:0%
JAPAN.

