WHILE SHE SAYS JAPAN'S AGING

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:27.413 line:0%
POPULATION IS THAT GREAT RISK

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:28.615 line:0%
OF ISOLATION, IT IS ACTUALLY

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.550 line:0%
THE YOUNG THAT SUFFER MOST.

