THE PSYCHOLOGICAL EFFECT OF

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:53.373 line:0%
LONELINESS ON INDIVIDUALS IS

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.441 line:0%
VERY HIGH.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.343 line:0%
