LIKELY IMPACTING MORE PEOPLE AS

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:00.547 line:0%
A RESULT OF THE PANDEMIC.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:02.415 line:0%
IN 2020, FOR THE FIRST TIME IN

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.650 line:0%
11 YEARS, THE SUICIDE RATE IN

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:05.418 line:0%
JAPAN INCREASED FROM THE

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:07.420 line:0%
PREVIOUS YEAR AND CHANGED.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:09.255 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE TYPICALLY HAPPENS DURING

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:11.457 line:0%
THE ECONOMY CRISIS, THE MIDDLE

