FOR NOW IT'S THE YOUNG ONES.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.497 line:0%
SOMETHING IS GOING ON.

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.997 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AND THE NUMBERS SHOW IT IS

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.465 line:0%
