ACCORDING TO THE NATIONAL

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:22.569 line:0%
POLICE AGENCY, THE SUICIDE RATE

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:26.239 line:0%
IN THE MONTH OF APRIL INCREASED

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:27.373 line:0%
MORE THAN 19% COMPARED TO LAST

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.508 line:0%
APRIL, WHILE THE PANDEMIC HAS

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.410 line:0%
CLAIMED MORE THAN 10,000 LIVES

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:32.512 line:0%
IN JAPAN DURING THAT TIME, MORE

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:33.379 line:0%
THAN 23,000 PEOPLE HAVE TAKEN

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:37.450 line:0%
THEIR OWN LIVES.

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.951 line:0%
FOR THIS PERSON, THOSE NUMBERS

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:39.519 line:0%
ARE PERSONAL.

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:41.254 line:0%
SHE EXPERIENCED LONELINESS,

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:42.488 line:0%
DEPRESSION AND CONTEMPLATED

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:42.822 line:0%
SUICIDE WHEN SHE WAS 30 YEARS

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:44.591 line:0%
OLD.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:45.491 line:0%
SHORTLY AFTER GIVING BIRTH TO

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:48.561 line:0%
HER FIRST CHILD.

