&gt;&gt; I WANTED TO DISAPPEAR.

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:52.365 line:0%
I DID NOT KNOW HOW TO HANDLE MY

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:53.566 line:0%
FEELINGS, AND IT WAS TOO

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.900 line:0%
PAINFUL TO THINK ABOUT WHAT TO

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:56.369 line:0%
DO.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.404 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ABOUT A DECADE LATER, SHE

00:03:56.536 --> 00:04:03.409 line:0%
