00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.445 line:0%
SERVICE FOR SOMEONE WHO JUST

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:07.480 line:0%
NEEDS TO LISTEN.

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:07.847 line:0%
SHE INTERACTS WITH 45 PEOPLE

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:10.250 line:0%
TODAY.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:10.950 line:0%
SHE USES HER OWN STRUGGLE WITH

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.253 line:0%
LONELINESS TO HELP OTHERS.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:14.420 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO SAY THAT YOU ARE

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.588 line:0%
NOT SO ALONE.

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:16.422 line:0%
WE SERIOUSLY WANT TO LISTEN TO

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:18.491 line:0%
YOUR STORY.

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:19.425 line:0%
VOICING YOUR CONCERN IS NEVER A

00:04:18.992 --> 00:04:21.261 line:0%
BAD THING.

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:22.462 line:0%
IT DOES NOT MEAN THAT YOU ARE

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.396 line:0%
RUNNING AWAY FROM THE PROBLEM

00:04:22.629 --> 00:04:25.465 line:0%
OR YOU ARE WEAK.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:28.234 line:0%
&gt;&gt; EXPERTS SAY ABOUT 30,000

00:04:25.632 --> 00:04:29.335 line:0%
PEOPLE HERE IN JAPAN DIE LONELY

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:31.237 line:0%
DEATHS EACH YEAR.

00:04:29.502 --> 00:04:31.638 line:0%
WHEN THAT HAPPENS, THIS IS THE

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:33.439 line:0%
RESULT.

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:36.209 line:0%
CLEANERS HAVE TO COME IN AND

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:36.576 line:0%
PICK UP THE PIECES OF A LIFE

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:40.380 line:0%
LOST.

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:42.482 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I CANNOT GET USED TO THIS.

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:44.617 line:0%
TIME HAS STOPPED HERE.

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:46.419 line:0%
I COULD FEEL WE KIND OF LIFE HE

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:51.224 line:0%
WAS HAVING HERE RIGHT AWAY.

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:51.591 line:0%
HONESTLY SPEAKING, MY HEART

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:54.227 line:0%
ACHES.

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:58.231 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IN TERMS OF JAPAN'S NEW

00:04:54.394 --> 00:05:00.466 line:0%
