00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:01.567 line:0%
HIS FIRST TASK IS TO IDENTIFY

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:03.369 line:0%
THOSE WHO ARE ISOLATED, LONELY

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:03.870 line:0%
