HE ALSO PLANS TO PROMOTE

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:08.441 line:0%
ACTIVITIES TO PROTECT THE TIES

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.243 line:0%
BETWEEN PEOPLE.

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:11.210 line:0%
IT'S WORTH NOTING THAT JAPAN IS

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.245 line:0%
