00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:19.285 line:0%
LONELINESS ENDURED BY THE

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:22.288 line:0%
ELDERLY.

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:23.456 line:0%
OF COURSE, ROBIN, THE ISSUE IS

00:05:22.455 --> 00:05:25.391 line:0%
SERIOUSLY IMPACTING BOYS AND

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:26.426 line:0%
GIRLS, MEN AND WOMEN OF ALL

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:28.628 line:0%
AGES HERE IN JAPAN.

